      "severity": "important",
      "category": "correctness",
      "title": "`crTrack.hasHeld` is never set to true, so the send button never appears",
      "description": "When the developer answers \"Wait\" (or dismisses), `this.held` is populated and they are told to \"send it from the Findings panel\", but the context key is only ever set to `false` (lines 464, 732). `package.json:211-212` gates the `crTrack.sendHeld` menu item on `when: view == crTrack.findings && crTrack.hasHeld`, so the button is never shown and the only way to send a held report is the command palette.",
      "suggestion": "Setting the context key to `true` alongside `this.held` in `confirmSend` would make the button appear.",
      "confidence": 0.92,
      "hadPatch": true,
      "status": "proposed",
      "accepted": false,
      "dismissReason": null,
      "detectedBy": "llm"
    },
